  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: INFO PANEL_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c368d9f5e238664b996a20a6bb76f90, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 8522797056
    m_Localized: GAME MODES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30840688640
    m_Localized: The score and the highscore are indicated at the bottom. And right
      bellow, there is also an indication of the points needed to unlock the next
      achievement (100 points).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12645797888
    m_Localized: "The amount of points you get in every round comes from adding:
      the number of the round, the number of push buttons and the extra points (depending
      on the game mode). On the example:\n     5 (number of the round)\n   +4 (number
      of pushbuttons)\n   +1 (accelerated mode)\n   +5 (reverse mode)\n       TOTAL=
      15 points"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335301021696
    m_Localized: From the game modes panel, select the number of colors you want
      to play with. The more colors you take,the more difficult the game will be,...
      but you will get more points!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337175875584
    m_Localized: You can also select the game speed. In the accelerated game mode,
      the game speed will increase quickly, but you will get an extra point each
      round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339310776320
    m_Localized: Here you can see a game mode than has been unlocked and selected.
      Every round you'll get 5 extra points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 468533088256
    m_Localized: This game mode is locked. You need to get 100 points to unblock
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 566260371456
    m_Localized: NORMAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 589643616256
    m_Localized: Repeat the pattern of colors previously showed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 613697949696
    m_Localized: REVERSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 615908347904
    m_Localized: Repeat the pattern of colors previously showed, but backwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 697990877184
    m_Localized: BLINDLY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 702457810944
    m_Localized: The whole pattern won't be showed every round, but only the new
      color you will have to remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 802034782208
    m_Localized: 'No so fast!

      Come back when you unlock this game mode.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 863108042752
    m_Localized: 'Every 3 rounds, 2 random colors will exchange their positions,
      crazy!

      Now the good thing, every 3 rounds the points you get will be
      multiplied by 2, then by 3, by 4, 5...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 1
